#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Does the Banner of Shielding affect the evade-in-any-direction optional rule?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:122
msgid ""
"_Can a Cavalry unit with base 6+ save and the Banner of Shielding (thereby "
"conferring 5+ save) use the optional “evade in any direction” rule? Or does "
"having the banner mean they lose that option?_"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:125
msgid ""
"Banners that provide bonuses to the unit’s statistic profile do not affect "
"other rules. So a cavalry unit with a base 6+ save and the Banner of "
"Shielding can still evade in any direction."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:128
msgid ""
"Likewise, a Cavalry unit with no save does not gain the optional evade in "
"any direction rule by taking the Banner of Shielding."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:131
msgid ""
"→ Rulebook: xref:movement.adoc#the-evade[Movement – The evade], xref:magic."
"adoc#banner-of-shielding[Magic – The Banner of Shielding]."
msgstr ""

