#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "How does the drive back roll for the Gerroff!!! spell work?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Roll one D6 and multiply the roll by 5 cm, giving a result of either 5, 10, "
"15, 20, 25 or 30 cm. This move is made directly towards the target’s own "
"board edge. Note that rolling a 6 for the Gerroff!!! distance does not cause "
"confusion, but if the target is forced to contact other units or terrain, "
"then it may be confused as per the standard confusion rules."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:171
msgid ""
"→ Armies book: xref:armies:goblins.adoc#gerroff[Goblins – Gerroff!!!], xref:"
"armies:orcs.adoc#gerroff[Orcs – Gerroff!!!]."
msgstr ""

