"Low’Key], xref:armies:dark-elves.adoc#general[Dark Elves – Special rules for "
"Generals]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:199
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is the range of the Araby Djinn’s shooting attack?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:203
