"It has the same range shooting attack as the unit it has joined. If the unit "
"has no shooting attack, use 30 cm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/unit-questions-and-answers.adoc:205
msgid ""
"→ Armies book: xref:armies:araby.adoc#djinn[Araby – Special rules for Djinn]."
